                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game takes the classic snake game and amps it up into a full blown game with tons of levels and new features that puts the snake you know and love on steroids. I really enjoy the chill atmosphere of the game and the minimalist art style. If you want a great challenge that is both addicting and sometimes downright frustrating, this game is for you! I highly recommend Ophidian.",
